  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經典音樂劇賞析",
    "sub_ename": "APPRECIATION OF CLASSIC MUSICALS",
    "describe_ch": "音樂劇是音樂、歌曲、舞蹈、戲劇、雜耍、特技和綜藝結合的一種音樂表演。\n本課程以通識多元為目標，採每學期5-6齣經典音樂劇作品賞析之方式教學。",
    "describe_eh": "Musical is a performance that combines music, songs, dance, drama and variety shows. \nThis course aims at general knowledge and diversity, and adopts the teaching method of appreciating 5-6 classic musicals per semester.",
